    tagline: "This target has been classified as a wood barge wreck.",
    summary: "Type: Vessel | Class: Barge Wreck | Subclass: Wood\nShipwreck City Data\nThis target has been classified as a wood barge wreck. Resting in 40 feet of water and measuring roughly 15 feet by 6 feet. Squared-off timber hull section is visable with the exposed wood coated in light growth and sediment, and a darker patch of buildup or debris settled against the structure. Parts of the structure have broken away leaving views into the interrior of the target. Possible debris inside. \nPrior Research and Theories\nThis target has been classified by Coastal Sensing & Survey as LU10, described as a small work barge. No additional narrative accompanies the entry beyond the classification and sonar imagery.",
