    summary: "Unknown (LU059)\nType: Vessell | Class: N/A | Subclass: N/A\n\nShipwreck City Data\nThis target has been classified as a shipwreck, resting in 40 feet of water, with dimensions still to be determined. It was originally identified through Coastal Sensing & Survey's side-scan sonar work rather than direct observation, and Shipwreck City has not yet dived or photographed the site to confirm what the sonar return represents.\n\nPrior Research and Theories\nThis target has been logged by Coastal Sensing & Survey under LU59, though no additional narrative accompanies the entry. No DCS Films or Lake Union Virtual Museum records exist for this target.",
